1 NOTE {geni:about_me} During the 1940s and 1950s (at least) Paul and Nina operated a guest house in Wellfleet. They were part of the intellectual social circle that included Edmund Wilson, and Wilson met his 4th wife Elena when she stay
2 CONC ed with Nina, a friend since childhood. They hosted Svetlana Stalin after her defection, and Paul translated her book.
