1 OCCU Electrical Engineer
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Electrical engineer who studied in Paris. Helped build the mills of "Los Palacios" and "Covadonga" in Cuba as well as some in Venezuela. Also helped create the trolley lines in Santiago de Cuba. Friends with Heming
2 CONC way and Yaborski (the man who introduced ballet to Cuba).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married twice, the first time to María Teresa Goizueta (deceased) in Paris. They had three children, one named Tatiana. Second marriage was to Victoria Saura of Pinar del Río, one child named Sacha.
2 CONT
2 CONT Information found in newspaper account regarding brother Alexander: http://www.juventudrebelde.cu/UserFiles/File/impreso/icuba-2009-05-27.pdf
2 CONT
