2 CONC th Alexandra Pavlovna Katkova-Shalikova  (28.7.1902-11.5.1975) Prince Andrei's son was kn.Mihail A. (8.2.1930-4.5.1993), married (to 27/06/1957) to Tatyana Yuryevna Kalganova (b. in Paris 12.17.1932) and had a son, Alexander (b. 3
2 CONC /25/1959). Last from the marriage with Pascale Torres (b. 1961) has a son - kn.Dmitriya Kurakin Alexandrovich (b. 3/28/1995 at Sevres). Alexander and Dmitry - the only living successors princely family Kurakins. Andrei's daughter 
2 CONC - Elizabeth (17.2.1937-16.2.1994), 1961 married Christian Dominice. 
