1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00152578&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Vaclav, Graf Dobrzensky de Dobrzenicz, was born on 9 October 1943 in Pottenstein, the son of Franz, Graf Dobrzensky de Dobrzenicz, and Eugénie, Gräfin Kinská z Vchynic a Tetova. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 10 March 1970 in Bogota, Colombia, he married Maria Christina Montalvo, daughter of José Antonio Montalvo and Isabelle Higuera. Vaclav died on 9 May 2003 in Rome, Italy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 'Vaclav XVII Count Dobrzensky von Dobrzenicz, known to his friends as Venda, died last night here in Rome after a long illness. He was 59 years old and he leaves a widow, the former Maria Cristina de Montalvo, a younger brother an
2 CONC d 4 nephews and nieces. He was a Knight of Honour and Devotion in the SMOM and two months ago was awarded the Grand Cross. He appeared in Federico Fellini's 'La Dolce Vita' as Prince Giovanni. He was a great gentleman, a wonderful
2 CONC  loyal friend, a man who never complained.' (Carlos de Vasconcellos)
