2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Ketevan Bagration of Mukhrani also known as Khétévane Bagrationi–Orsini, Ketevan Bagrationi–Mukhraneli, or Ketevan Bagrationi–Mukhranbatoni (Georgian: ქეთევან ბაგრატიონ–მუხრანელი) (born July 20, 1954) is a French-born Ita
2 CONC lian–Georgian public figure and diplomat, who was Georgia's ambassador to the Holy See from 2005 to 2014 and again since 2019. She has a dual French and Georgian citizenship.
