2 CONC  1961) has a son - kn.Dmitriya Kurakin Alexandrovich (b. 3/28/1995 at Sevres). Alexander and Dmitry - the only living successors princely family Kurakins. Andrei's daughter - Elizabeth (17.2.1937-16.2.1994), 1961 married Christian
2 CONC  Dominice.
